; Lighting pass 1
; - lower uniform ambient so volume comes from direct + indirect light
; - enable SSIL as near-field detail on top of SDFGI
; - widen room fixtures so they overlap instead of forming isolated pools
; - add light size on primary room fixtures for PCSS penumbras
; - increase indirect contribution for SDFGI
; - connector lights act as cheap no-shadow continuity/fill lights

